Text:
The Reconciliator makes the desk run one program when a person opens a file with one of some extensions.
A 'program' is named by the TaggedText that encodes the path of that program.
os.holders is a Holders: (OSExtension->TaggedText) is in os.holders exactly while the desk runs the program TaggedText when a person opens a file with the extension OSExtension.
The program TaggedText 'holds' OSExtension when (OSExtension->TaggedText) is in os.holders.
os.setups is a Setups: (TaggedText->Extensions) is in os.setups exactly while the desk keeps what reconciliator$reconcile wrote for the program TaggedText, and Extensions are the extensions that reconciliator$reconcile wrote for.
A person, and a program that is not the Reconciliator, can change os.holders at any moment.
//later: how the person is asked to let a program hold an extension, and which program shows that question
//later: what the Reconciliator writes on each desk, and how the Reconciliator reads os.holders and os.setups on each desk
//later: the icons that the desk shows for the files of an extension and for the windows of a program
//later: the program of a Setup that reconciliator$reconcile removes is told before the Setup is removed
//later: an extension that a program stops holding goes back to the program that held that extension before
//later: two calls of reconciliator$reconcile never run at the same time on one desk

Grammar:
Extensions ::= OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn
Holders ::= Holder1 .. Holdern
Holder ::= (OSExtension->TaggedText)
Setups ::= Setup1 .. Setupn
Setup ::= (TaggedText->Extensions)

Well formedness:
in Extensions: if Extensions is OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn, then OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn are disjoint
in Holders: if Holders is (OSExtension1->_) .. (OSExtensionn->_), then OSExtension1 .. OSExtensionn are disjoint
in Setups: if Setups is (TaggedText1->_) .. (TaggedTextn->_), then TaggedText1 .. TaggedTextn are disjoint

Signature: reconciliator$givenUp(TaggedText,Extensions) = Extensions'//the extensions of Extensions that the person does not let the program TaggedText hold; the person is asked only about an extension that a program with no Setup in os.setups holds

Signature: reconciliator$reconcile(TaggedText,Extensions) = Extensions'//makes the program TaggedText hold the extensions of Extensions that the person lets that program hold; Extensions' are the other extensions of Extensions

Define reconciliator$reconcile(TaggedText,Extensions):
A fact reconciliator$givenUp(TaggedText,Extensions) = Extensions
B action return Extensions

Define reconciliator$reconcile(TaggedText,Extensions):
A fact reconciliator$givenUp(TaggedText,Extensions) = Extensions'
B fact {OSExtension0 .. OSExtensionn} = Extensions - Extensions'
C action os.setups= (TaggedText->OSExtension0 .. OSExtensionn)
D action the desk is changed so that (OSExtension0->TaggedText) .. (OSExtensionn->TaggedText) are in os.holders
E action return Extensions'
